format  i3s-statistics
version 0.1.0
distribution public
source  "Indexed 3D Scene Layers (I3S, OGC Community Standard 17-014), specification text at https://github.com/Esri/i3s-spec commit 6cfdef9024ca1abc6c9f3b408ce941abfe287f0e, docs/1.10/stats.cmn.md. Member layouts restated by goat-transformers; the specification text is not copied or modified"
uses    i3s
